      "sourceSha256": "04f3ec47a49c119d0f65c1963dc17ec7b0f146500a23ba9cb70e0295a998ab17",
      "patch": "scripts/openui-each-counter.mjs",
      "patchSha256": "14548fa7124435807c93d5b7f2a5b69a1f5bcca9f6505061d924994c8ea01cfd",
      "description": "Applied to the bundled copy only, never to node_modules. Evaluation counters charge loops, constructed values, component props, recursive literal substitution, schema validation, implicit string conversion and returned data before expensive expansion. AST walkers preserve preorder and visitor-added children while visiting shared objects once and enforcing the parse limit. Parser materialization also reports its node count. A refused evaluation returns an empty value; parse limits surface as the source fallback. Every patch matches the pinned upstream source exactly or the build fails."
    }
  ],
  "runtime": {
    "@openuidev/react-lang": "1.0.2",
